{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1914"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c160): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c160.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1914"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge history/modern-history","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/history__modern-history.g4.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",595],["+"," Among the children he adopted was the orphan Sabiha Gökçen (1913–2001), whom he met in Bursa in 1925. Trained as a pilot, she flew combat missions in the Dersim operations of 1937 at the age of 23 and is regarded as the world's first female fighter pilot; Istanbul's second airport bears her name."],["=",41],["+","He came as a follower of Zionism, the Jewish national movement that had emerged in late nineteenth-century Europe as a reaction to growing antisemitism; Theodor Herzl gave it a programme in \"Der Judenstaat\" (1896) and convened the First Zionist Congress in Basel in 1897. "],["=",343]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",581],["+"," Zu den Kindern, die er adoptierte, gehörte die Waise Sabiha Gökçen (1913–2001), die er 1925 in Bursa kennengelernt hatte. Als Pilotin ausgebildet, flog sie 1937 mit 23 Jahren bei den Dersim-Operationen Kampfeinsätze und gilt als erste Kampfpilotin der Welt; Istanbuls zweiter Flughafen trägt ihren Namen."],["=",43],["+","Er kam als Anhänger des Zionismus, der jüdischen Nationalbewegung, die im späten 19. Jahrhundert in Europa als Reaktion auf den wachsenden Antisemitismus entstanden war; Theodor Herzl gab ihr mit „Der Judenstaat“ (1896) ein Programm und berief 1897 den Ersten Zionistenkongress in Basel ein. "],["=",323]]}]},
{"seq":3,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1914"},"reason":"a1914 body: \"flew combat missions … in 1937 at the age of 23\" → age removed (Gökçen, born March 1913, was 24 during the 1937 Dersim operations; Wikipedia's \"at age 23\" doesn't match the date) — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sabiha_G%C3%B6k%C3%A7en","by":"enrich batch 100","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a1914-a2370.md","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sabiha_G%C3%B6k%C3%A7en"}]},
