{"seq":53,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1914"},"reason":"Notes added: Guinness World Records recognises Sabiha Gökçen as the first female combat pilot; earlier women flew reconnaissance (Shakhovskaya, 1914) or volunteer bombing raids (Marvingt, 1915) but none was a fighter pilot.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/first-female-combat-pilot"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marie_Marvingt"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evgeniya_Shakhovskaya"}],"changes":[{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["+","Guinness World Records recognises Sabiha Gökçen as the world's first female combat pilot (1936–37). Earlier women flew other kinds of military missions: Evgeniya Shakhovskaya flew reconnaissance for Russia in 1914, and Marie Marvingt flew volunteer bombing raids for France in 1915; neither was a fighter pilot."]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["+","Guinness World Records führt Sabiha Gökçen als erste Kampfpilotin der Welt (1936–37). Schon früher flogen Frauen andere militärische Einsätze: Jewgenija Schachowskaja flog 1914 Aufklärung für Russland, Marie Marvingt 1915 freiwillige Bombenangriffe für Frankreich; Jagdfliegerin war keine von beiden."]]},{"field":"notesRu","diff":[["+","Книга рекордов Гиннесса признаёт Сабиху Гёкчен первой в мире женщиной — боевым лётчиком (1936–1937). Женщины и раньше выполняли другие военные полёты: Евгения Шаховская летала на разведку для России в 1914 году, а Мари Марвенг в 1915 году добровольно участвовала в бомбардировках на стороне Франции; ни одна из них не была лётчиком-истребителем."]]}],"hash":"1a98ec1b64da","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"f8d9d10492dfbceee62c6860ab67916579fc84d07bd1d03406b8fb9f38c6fc91"},
